  "10.5.80.1(4)@1075-2026": {"explanation": "In the Residential Zone category, a solar parking canopy over parking may be built in any front, side or rear yard without meeting the building setback. Its edge and supports may extend 0.5 m beyond the parking space, it may be 4.0 m high (6.0 m with an apartment building), and its area does not count toward lot coverage.", "code_refs": "none"}}}
